Comment: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:21.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:28.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.31,0:01:44.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It may have been her own inexperience\Nthat caused the tragic incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:49.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, the young life lost\Non the battlefield...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...was not a small misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:58.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobody could hope to comfort\Nthe grief-stricken Kai Shiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.11,0:02:04.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The White Base was now above\Nthe South American continent...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:08.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...on its way to Jaburo, the\NFederation Forces headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.41,0:02:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it.\NThe Trojan Horse is headed for Jaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:41.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as our spy reported. Don't lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.29,0:03:02.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Butterfly! Butterfly! Butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.15,0:03:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Butter... fly! Butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:07.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're so beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:08.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, we've finally made it\Nto the Federation Forces' dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.19,0:03:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.01,0:03:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:25.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attention all hands!\NWe're entering Jaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.13,0:03:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep watching for any enemy aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:34.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said we're entering Jaburo,\Nbut I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:35.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:16.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Landing completed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:25.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse's signal disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:31.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means we've finally located\Nthe biggest entrance to Jaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:34.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Conduct a thorough search of the area\Nwhere the Trojan Horse disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll crush the ship and the Jaburo base!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The damage is quite extensive.\NWorse than what they reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:51.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, the White Base has certainly seen\Na lot of heavy combat...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:55.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right! Commence inspection!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:58.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commence inspection procedures!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:05:01.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First and second teams,\Nprepare for inspection!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:05.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be Captain Woody...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:09.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Bright Noa,\Nchief officer of the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:11.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:13.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there a young man here\Nnamed Amuro Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:15.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:19.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's Amuro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:20.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never expected somebody so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you want, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the pilot of the Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:31.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Matilda told me a lot about you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Matilda told you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.53,0:05:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.53,0:05:41.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They called it a Zock. Mobile Suit Zock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:42.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.11,0:05:46.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's amphibious, with a jumping capability\Nseveral times that of a Zaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.41,0:05:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.24,0:05:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The engineers at North America's California Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:51.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:54.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope it isn't just for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:07.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As soon as the reinforcements arrive from the California Base we'll send our second attack team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:11.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll go as an advance party, so carry out\Nyour mission to the best of your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:37.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:40.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never expected a physical examination\Nto be such a chore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:42.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:47.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Amuro, your exam was especially long.\NWas there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way. They were all busy checking\Nbrain waves and taking x-rays and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:52.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Same with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.27,0:06:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:58.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They told me I'm physically healthy\Nand mentally sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:01.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This medical facility is perfectly\Nfurnished with everything imaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:02.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:04.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:06.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Katz, Letz, please keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:08.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with these bodies? Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:12.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like you don't have any cavities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.59,0:07:21.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to get some rest, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:28.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Supervision is a thankless job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I do anything to help out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:34.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as you're at Jaburo,\Nyou can relax and leave it all to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:37.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:39.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain. Did you know Lt. Matilda well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.19,0:07:45.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After Operation Odessa was over \Nwe were planning to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:47.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.49,0:07:50.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We expected that the White Base\Nwould arrive at Jaburo in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...so Matilda had hoped to have\Nthe crew attend our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:59.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,l-ls that so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:27.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I'm sorry, Captain Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:34.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I'd only known how to use\Nthe Gundam better...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:37.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...then Ms. Matilda wouldn't have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:38.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be so conceited, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.59,0:08:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Gundam alone can't win the war,\Nnor could it have saved Matilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.59,0:08:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:55.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If a pilot fights as best he can in each battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:59.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and doesn't do anything\Nthat he'd later regret, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:00.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:05.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love the White Base because I know\NMatilda cared so much about this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:07.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm doing my best\Nto get it fully repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:09.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both of us are doing our duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:27.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I found it. The main entrance to Jaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:31.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't got a metallic reaction,\NI would have missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:35.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means they'd never\Nlaunch an attack here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't want anyone\Nto see through the camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.69,0:09:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In conclusion, the White Base corps\Nshall continue their mission as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.69,0:09:47.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.78,0:09:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, you will be assigned to the Tianem fleet...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:54.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but official notice will only be given just before the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.37,0:09:57.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. What should we do in the meantime?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:10:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rest up in your assigned quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:01.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, you will not be penalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Mirai, please consider it as\Nour repaying a favor to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My father?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:13.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To this day, we regret the Federation's loss\Nof such a valuable politician.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:17.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If your father were alive today,\Nyou wouldn't have had to emigrate to Side 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:19.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, sir, I would rather not discuss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:20.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.89,0:10:24.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enemy approaching hatches 231 and 243\Nof the South Block!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:27.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take level 2 battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:30.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another patrol?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:32.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you may return to your quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to alert status, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:36.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:40.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, Lt. Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I must apologize for bringing a force\Nthat's too small for a first-wave attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:47.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long until we reach Jaburo, Lt. Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:51.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Less than an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:03.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should we attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that'd reveal our location. Hold off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:08.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two are Goggs, for underwater combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.94,0:11:10.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The other one isn't in the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.69,0:11:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A new model of mobile suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attention all units in Jaburo's South Block!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to level 2 battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:20.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:20.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:22.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:23.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:30.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:32.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:36.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone's taking level 2 battle stations,\Nso where else are we going to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:37.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The others are coming as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:40.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:46.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many went up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but there were at least four.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only one is authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The others are for camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're coming!\NSwitch to level 1 battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:09.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Signal flare confirmed at bearing 128.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:11.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:48.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain! We've been ordered\Nto take level 1 battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the crew aboard the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:56.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've finished repairs on the mobile suits\Nbut the White Base itself isn't operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.11,0:13:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow, Mirai! Get intel from\NGeneral HQ as quickly as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:20.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't make a move until\Nwe know what's going on out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.53,0:13:24.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:27.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,General HQ, how is the enemy deployed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:28.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we launch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir! We can guard the entrance to Jaburo...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll send Amuro and Sayla in the G-Bull.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.13,0:13:37.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that! Send out Kai and Hayato\Nin the Guncannon and Guntank! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe those Zeons\Nfollowed us all the way out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.47,0:13:45.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miharu. I won't mope about any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:49.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll totally crush Zeon, so people\Nwon't have to suffer like you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:54.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guntank, Hayato, rolling out!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro! Ready?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go ahead!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:13:59.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}G-Bull, Sayla and Amuro, launching!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.91,0:14:07.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! Let's stay close to\NJaburo's entranceway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:09.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy will try to force their way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:10.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.91,0:14:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh... Gundams?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:17.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Those are GMs,\Nthe Gundam's mass-production type.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.55,0:14:28.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First wave of Zakus,{\i}\N{\i1}Goufs and Doms going in.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:32.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Captain Char,{\i}\N{\i1}please launch your Z'Gok team last.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:33.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger, Lt. Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:40.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Li Hwan! Jittal! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.49,0:14:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:13.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've already lost Li Hwan!\NJaburo is well defended.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many mobile suits will land safely?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! J-Jittal, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:30.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's vital that I join up with the advance party.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:35.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like 28 mobile suits have landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's quite a large force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.75,0:15:41.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. But I believe it's still too small\Nto fight against all of Jaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're only targeting A Block\Nwhere the spaceship dock is located.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:47.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base must have been followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:48.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:52.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the White Base will always be\Na nuisance to the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:57.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still haven't heard anything\Nat all from General HQ, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Switch all monitors over\Nto external surveillance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.65,0:16:01.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't fight like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:03.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,General HQ will hear from me later!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:08.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a situation...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we carelessly go outside, that will{\i}\N{\i1}give away the location of Jaburo's entrance.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:14.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At this rate...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.50,0:16:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have no idea what the enemy is doing,\Nso there's no way for us to fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:24.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we moved out and found the enemy\Nin front of us, we'd be toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.55,0:16:27.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't even avenge Miharu, can I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're coming... Damn Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:54.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boraskyniv. How are things proceeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:57.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! We just finished setting the explosives.\NShould we break in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:16:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not yet. Are we going from the front?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:02.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any other entrances?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a smaller entrance...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:05.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...about 500 meters upstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.59,0:17:08.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm... We'll attack both at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:10.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The two Goggs will breach this entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:13.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boraskyniv and I will break through\Nthe one upstream. Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.28,0:17:29.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:44.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-They're here! It's Zeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:46.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They allowed Zeon to break through?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:48.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could they...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:50.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Workers, join the defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:56.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Matilda sacrificed her life\Nto protect the White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:58.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way that I'll let it be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:03.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get close to the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One Gogg destroyed!\NKai took it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, {\i1}Ms. Sayla! The G-Bull must turn back!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:24.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The enemy broke through another entrance.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.13,0:18:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's leave the rest to Mr. Kai and Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:27.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:33.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems many have broken through, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zeon scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:40.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's our White Base you're attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow! Instruct the G-Bull\Nto change to the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:47.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy mobile suits are advancing quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.73,0:18:48.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.94,0:18:51.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Bull! G-Bull!\NPlease Convert to Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:56.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger! What's invading?{\i}\N{\i1}Are they Zakus? Or Goufs?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:19:00.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B Deck! Please send out G-Armor's B-Parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A hovercraft is no use here! Please fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? That's Captain Woody!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.11,0:19:33.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain! Don't do it!\NF-Fall back now, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:41.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A red mobile suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not a Zaku.\NBut could the red mobile suit mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:46.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...that Char's here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A GM!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:58.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't close in carelessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.97,0:20:00.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake... It's him...\NHe's come back to fight us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:36.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it... That's Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:47.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it you, Char?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gotten even better, Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.61,0:21:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn Zeon!\NGet out of Jaburo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:08.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Woody! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:10.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.30,0:21:17.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Woody...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.76,0:21:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The main camera has been damaged!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:27.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boraskyniv! Do you read me?!\NI need some backup now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:33.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way.\N I'm taking out Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:37.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:51.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That mobile suit... I'm certain it was Char.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.29,0:21:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Char has pursued us\Nall the way to Jaburo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro! Do you read me? Are you all right?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:02.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.59,0:22:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I let one mobile suit escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.39,0:22:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You did very well.{\i}\N{\i1}We destroyed most of the enemy force.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.85,0:22:10.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But they did a lot of damage.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.31,0:22:11.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.66,0:22:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Woody was a casualty...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:31.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.75,0:22:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must have cared about the White Base\Neven more than we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.08,0:22:36.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...That's how it seemed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.84,0:22:37.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:42.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Men can feel emotion so strongly sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.01,0:22:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:45.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.14,0:22:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh... And Char's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.81,0:22:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char? Did you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.73,0:22:54.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. I only saw a red mobile suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:22:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but I'm positive that it was Char, the Red Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.67,0:23:23.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who would ever call Katz, Letz and Kikka\N"nothing but a nuisance"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.01,0:23:28.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And who will find the enemy's time bombs\Nin time to save Jaburo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:33.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile, Char and Sayla meet...\Nfor the second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NA Wish of War Orphans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:40.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
